  "description": {
    "text": "VMAX Special Set, released on 23 October 2020: one pack of every Sword & Shield expansion released so far, eight in all, and a VMAX promo pack holding one of four Pokémon VMAX with three holo basic Energy of its type. Dhelmise VMAX and Cramorant VMAX were new cards; Cinderace VMAX and Morpeko VMAX came with new artwork. This set holds the promo packs' cards.",
